      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The Output's Send section is open, and nothing is sent until you press a button. Name is what other apps list it as. Syphon hands it to another app on this Mac \u2014 a VJ app, a mapper, OBS \u2014 and NDI\u00ae sends it to any machine on the network, once the free NDI runtime is installed. A sent Output stays live with its tab closed; the Main Mixer sends the whole mix the same way."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
